Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.59,0:02:55.59,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\pos(473.6,186.4)}放手去做吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.59,0:02:55.59,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\pos(619.2,240.8)}往往可以做得更多。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.59,0:02:55.59,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\pos(768,202.4)}时间不充裕时、
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.59,0:02:55.59,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\pos(1097.6,322.4)}第八页
